# Training loop facade.
#
# Public import: importa ex "gradus:train" privata train
# Depends on: gradus:tensor, gradus:gradient, gradus:loss, gradus:optimize
#
# Will split into nested leaves when ≥2 training concerns are implemented:
#   gradus:train/loop       forward → loss → backward → step structure
#   gradus:train/metric     loss, accuracy, perplexity tracking
#   gradus:train/checkpoint model save/load (future; depends on safetensors rung)
#
# Architectural rule: the training loop is reusable across models. It must not
# import from a specific model definition. A model definition does not own its
# training loop.
